<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish March producer prices unchanged from February.</title>
<headline>Irish March producer prices unchanged from February.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for manufacturing industries were unchanged in March from February and were down 2.4 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics office data showed on Friday.  </p>
<p>	 Index (base 1985) Monthly change Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month     118.7	    uch	    -2.4</p>
<p>Previous month   118.7	   -0.3	    -2.1</p>
<p>Year-ago month   121.6	   +0.2	    +1.9</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom - 353-1-6613377</p>
</text>
